<html>
  <body>
    <h1>Bizzlo Document Quality Checklist</h1>
    <p>Use this checklist before moving a student file to Videshway admin review.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Passport scan is clear and valid.</li>
      <li>Academic transcripts and certificates are readable.</li>
      <li>English test or MOI evidence matches the destination requirement.</li>
      <li>SOP, LOR, CV, and finance documents are named clearly.</li>
      <li>Rejected documents are replaced before resubmission.</li>
    </ul>
  </body>
</html>
